==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-sadness.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Etymology===
{{suffix|sad|ness}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|sadnesses}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} The state or [[emotion]] of being [[sad]].
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} An event in one's [[life]] that causes sadness.
#: ''She has experienced many '''sadnesses''' in her forty years.''

====Synonyms====
* (''state of being sad''): [[forlornness]], [[melancholy]]
* (''event causing sadness''): [[misfortune]], [[woe]]

